    <briefdescription>
<para>Config-reactive DocumentWindow for END. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classend_1_1_window" kindref="compound">end::Window</ref> extends <ref refid="classjam_1_1Window" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/docs/tagfile.xml">jam::Window</ref> with listener-driven style application. Visual properties (glass: tint colour, blur radius, WindowFX) are applied via lookAndFeelChanged(), which reads from the LAF at theme-change time. Operational properties (always_on_top, buttons) are driven by <ref refid="classconfig_1_1_model" kindref="compound">config::Model</ref> listener via styleParameters — a <ref refid="structjam_1_1Function_1_1Map" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/docs/tagfile.xml">jam::Function::Map</ref> keyed on <ref refid="classjuce_1_1Identifier" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/tagfile.xml">juce::Identifier</ref> storing one typed callable per config property.</para>
<para>Config tree shape navigated by the dispatcher: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">CONFIG</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>DISPLAY<sp/><sp/>(IDtype::display)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>WINDOW<sp/><sp/>(IDtype::window)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>always_on_top,<sp/>buttons</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
